{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484233,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-05T21:17:56.536Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484233-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484233-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484233-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484233-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot’s Inkbox MCP connect card fails before OAuth starts with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCouldn’t start sign-in: Unsupported redirect_uri\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnector: Inkbox (plugin id \u003ccode\u003e57102943\u003c/code\u003e, MCP server \u003ccode\u003euser-Inkbox\u003c/code\u003e, status \u003ccode\u003eneedsAuth\u003c/code\u003e). Triggered via \u003ccode\u003eAuthenticateMcpServer\u003c/code\u003e for account=default so agents can send urgent SMS/iMessage to Holiday.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpected: sign-in / OAuth starts from the connect card.\u003cbr\u003e\nActual: sign-in never starts; the card shows Unsupported redirect_uri with Retry. Card copy: “Give Cursor an Inkbox identity for email, SMS, iMessage, voice calls, contacts, n…”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484233-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484233-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn Grok Bot, try to connect / re-authenticate the Inkbox MCP connector (plugin 57102943 / server \u003ccode\u003euser-Inkbox\u003c/code\u003e).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve the connect card.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNote it never opens a browser sign-in flow; it stays on Unsupported redirect_uri.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484233-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484233-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOAuth / Inkbox sign-in starts with a valid redirect_uri registered for Grok Bot’s MCP connect flow, so the connector can leave needsAuth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484233-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484233-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/0/2/02a9890cae659dcf1a8caf2e8c08f30e357de34b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/nybkv34JQsJ5sNrCRfEltUS975.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"inkbox-unsupported-redirect-uri.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/2/02a9890cae659dcf1a8caf2e8c08f30e357de34b_2_690x376.jpeg\" alt=\"inkbox-unsupported-redirect-uri.jpeg\" data-base62-sha1=\"nybkv34JQsJ5sNrCRfEltUS975\" width=\"690\" height=\"376\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/2/02a9890cae659dcf1a8caf2e8c08f30e357de34b_2_690x376.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/2/02a9890cae659dcf1a8caf2e8c08f30e357de34b_2_1035x564.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/0/2/02a9890cae659dcf1a8caf2e8c08f30e357de34b.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EAEAEA\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003einkbox-unsupported-redirect-uri.jpeg\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u00